    },
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100071/1802001000710010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000710020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "芸能人が自分から明かす場合は\r\n企業へのアピールとかメリットがあると思うんだけど",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100071/1802001000710020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000710030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "ファンがそれを知りたがるのって\r\nどういう心境なのかしら？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100071/1802001000710030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンの心境か、そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "綺麗な髪に\r\n憧れるんじゃないか",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000711"
  },
  {
    "select": "真似したいんだと思う",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000712"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "かなは知りたいと\r\n思わないのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000713"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000710040,
    "label": "1802001000711",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "たしかに、髪が綺麗な人を見ると\r\nああなりたい、って思うものね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100071/1802001000710040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000710050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "私も髪には気を遣ってるし\r\nみんなが憧れる存在を目指したいわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100071/1802001000710050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000710060,
    "label": "1802001000712",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "同じものを使いたい、ってこと？\r\n髪質とか、人によって合う合わないがあると思うけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100071/1802001000710060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000710070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "憧れの人とおそろいだって喜ぶ気持ちは\r\nわからなくもないかもね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100071/1802001000710070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000710080,
    "label": "1802001000713",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "うーん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
